{"id":"ad4b08ee803904de","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-halt-notation.md","title":"Definedness and Halting Notation","display":"df-halt-notation — Definedness and Halting Notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-halt-notation","aliases":["57-df-halt-notation"],"display":"df-halt-notation — Definedness and Halting Notation","depends_on":["[[57-df-partial-function]]","[[57-df-turing-machine]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-halt-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-halt-notation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-halt-notation — Definedness and Halting Notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\rightharpoonup B\">\\(f:A\\rightharpoonup B\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a> 的部分函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；机器及运行取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a>。两种 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow\">\\(\\downarrow\\)</span> 依左侧输入类型区分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:A\\rightharpoonup B\">\\(g:A\\rightharpoonup B\\)</span> 用于部分值相等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\qquad\nf(x)\\uparrow\\leftrightarrow x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\qquad\nf(x)\\uparrow\\leftrightarrow x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M(w)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j)),\\qquad\nM(w)\\uparrow\\leftrightarrow\\neg(M(w)\\downarrow).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M(w)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j)),\\qquad\nM(w)\\uparrow\\leftrightarrow\\neg(M(w)\\downarrow).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(x)\\simeq g(x)\\leftrightarrow\n[(f(x)\\uparrow\\land g(x)\\uparrow)\\lor\n\\exists y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in g)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(x)\\simeq g(x)\\leftrightarrow\n[(f(x)\\uparrow\\land g(x)\\uparrow)\\lor\n\\exists y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in g)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:A\\rightharpoonup B$ 为 [[57-df-partial-function]] 的部分函数图，$x\\in A$。$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$、$w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$；机器及运行取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。两种 $\\downarrow$ 依左侧输入类型区分。$g:A\\rightharpoonup B$ 用于部分值相等。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:A\\rightharpoonup B$ 为 [[57-df-partial-function]] 的部分函数图，$x\\in A$。$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$、$w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$；机器及运行取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。两种 $\\downarrow$ 依左侧输入类型区分。$g:A\\rightharpoonup B$ 用于部分值相等。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:A\\rightharpoonup B","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"g:A\\rightharpoonup B","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\qquad\nf(x)\\uparrow\\leftrightarrow x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f).","display":true},{"tex":"M(w)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j)),\\qquad\nM(w)\\uparrow\\leftrightarrow\\neg(M(w)\\downarrow).","display":true},{"tex":"f(x)\\simeq g(x)\\leftrightarrow\n[(f(x)\\uparrow\\land g(x)\\uparrow)\\lor\n\\exists y\\in B\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in g)].","display":true}],"bytes":1061,"backlinks":[{"id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$；$D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。固定 [[57-df-program-numbering]] 的程序编号、[[57-df-t-predicate]] 的实际停机历史关系 $T_n$ 及 [[57-df-machine-coding]] 的总输出提取函数 $U$；不更换编号。$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，该编号的正规形和有效参数化性质取 [[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]。$\\varphi_e^{(n)}$ 为部分函数图，$\\varphi_e$ 默认为一元实例；多元调用使用同一打包映射。停机与部分值相等取 [[57-df-halt-notation]]。$\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 是下式的谓词见证搜索，只在存在历史时定义；不将广义部分函数搜索与普通集合最小元混淆，参见 [[57-df-minimum-operator]]、[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]。"},{"id":"b1118344012e3e87","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\varphi_e:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 是 [[57-df-phi-e]] 的同一编号的一元部分函数图，而非机器对象本身。$\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow$ 取 [[57-df-halt-notation]]，等价于 $x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)$；$T$ 取 [[57-df-t-predicate]]。"},{"id":"4c97a440c08bba55","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_n$；$D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。$T_n,U,\\varphi_e^{(n)}$ 使用 [[57-df-phi-e]] 绑定的同一实际计算编号；$\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\mathrm{PartRec}_{n+1}$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]、[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]。$\\simeq$ 为 [[57-df-halt-notation]] 的部分值相等，并向部分表达式作同一图语义解释；$\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 取 [[57-df-phi-e]] 的见证搜索。$h$ 的输入按下式明确展开为 $n+1$ 个分量。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":["cda5e2779ea7246f","20d4e2ccede99498"]}